Rule 9 (abs tensor should not contain NaN values)
{v_1 : tensor} |= min(v_1) = min(v_1)
>>
Rule 10 (the dimensions of abs and angle must be non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 11 (if one of abs or angle is empty the other one must also be empty)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 0 ∧ ∃j ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, j) = 0) ∨ (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 ∧ ∀j ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, j) > 0)
